requirements.detail:
Successive graduation marks at 1 m/s and 5 m/s intervals on each scale must have the following precise distances based on the scale factors: 
a) Scale Factor 1 cm = 1 km (2 min time interval): 1.2 mm distance for 1 m/s and 6.0 mm distance for 5 m/s; 
b) Scale Factor 2 cm = 1 km (printed as 12cm=lkm / 2 min time interval): 2.4 mm distance for 1 m/s and 12.0 mm distance for 5 m/s; 
c) Scale Factor 4 cm = 1 km (2 min time interval): 4.8 mm distance for 1 m/s and 24.0 mm distance for 5 m/s.

Prescribes the exact vertical lengths of the engraved graduation lines to ensure clear readability: 
a) 1 m/s marks: 5 mm length; 
b) 5 m/s marks: 8 mm length; 
c) 10 m/s marks: 10 mm length.
